Z||000000||FieroMGDriver||11-14-2001||05:17 PM||||If I put a 3.4 from a camaro in my car, what do I need to do besides redrill holes for the starter?  Do I retain my wiring harness and everything else?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Scott||11-14-2001||09:03 PM||||The best way for you to get the info you want is to do a search on this subject.  It's been discussed many times.  And, you can retain most of your factory engine controls, if you treat the 3.4 as though it were a long block replacement engine.||||reg||1
